{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge of the Gods and fight them in the <strong>fast-paced deckbuilder</strong> fused <strong>with grid-based tactics</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight</strong> with the <strong>unique deck</strong> that you <strong>build on the fly</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover cards</strong> which work efficiently together.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>T</strong>here are <strong>75 unique cards</strong>, each has its own <strong>skill tree</strong>, each has it's own character,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/52d208aebed5c10a3937555c8168d755.webp?t=1758992894\" width=600 height=54 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/7dbd6b1e9c2c0f4fcdbf1c439d7089ef.poster.avif?t=1758992894\" width=600 height=132 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/7dbd6b1e9c2c0f4fcdbf1c439d7089ef.webm?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/7dbd6b1e9c2c0f4fcdbf1c439d7089ef.mp4?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/fc7b0f89d1261d69820b36907edac595.webp?t=1758992894\" width=600 height=54 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Considering the cards you have and gain during the run, manipulate the tiles of <strong>hex-based battlefield</strong> to get advantage. And don't let enemies to use them against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn </strong>special abilities of each enemy - and invent ways to turn them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet horrifying gods-bosses and burn them from existence by your unstoppable flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/a62e933383c6a0577f7ad08c1a3dfd00.poster.avif?t=1758992894\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/a62e933383c6a0577f7ad08c1a3dfd00.webm?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/a62e933383c6a0577f7ad08c1a3dfd00.mp4?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage into existential conversations with your avatar - <strong>God of Destruction</strong> named <strong>Shakrah</strong>. Will He be always agree on who is actually in charge here? Sure, He will always have something to discuss with you and something to argue about. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/d5bc33fbf05d669399d2ee8f180e5405.poster.avif?t=1758992894\" width=600 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/d5bc33fbf05d669399d2ee8f180e5405.webm?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/d5bc33fbf05d669399d2ee8f180e5405.mp4?t=1758992894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2489340/extras/8a7ea422